This u56_LSMS_MT contains input data and testing run on Vista GH node

1.> u56_LSMS_CPU
This folder has original input data for running mst2 CPU version

2.> reference_run_1
This folder has the input copied from u56_LSMS_MT, revise the i_mst, replace the 

No. Energy Grids           ::  32

by

No. Energy Grids           ::  1

This will run this case with 1 energy point. The outputs are
CoCrFeMnNi_mt_w
Evec_input.dat_out
k_n0000000_CoCrFeMnNi
mstrun.xml
o_n0000000_CoCrFeMnNi

The o_n0000000_CoCrFeMnNi has timing and accuracy information


staff.vista(1063)$ grep Time o_n0000000_CoCrFeMnNi 
