Time:: Job total including IO :     125.479 Sec

Each line with invertBlockMatrix has the timing for the LU invertion, as good measure of math performance, and it is the target for GPU acceleration.

The physics numbers used to check numerical consistency can be extracted by

staff.vista(1064)$ ./numerical_accuracy.sh o_n0000000_CoCrFeMnNi 

=================== ITERATION 01 ===================
  Fermi Energy DOS per Site           =   21.805050732917
  Fermi Energy (Ryd)                  =   0.89061985808
